#: src/likeback.cpp:231
#, kde-format
msgid "&Send a Comment to the Developers"
msgstr "&Enviarlles un comentario aos desenvolvedores"

#: src/likeback.cpp:239
#, kde-format
msgid "Show &Feedback Icons"
msgstr "Mostrar iconas de &comentarios"

#: src/likeback.cpp:307
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, header text for test apps"
msgid "Welcome to this testing version of %1."
msgstr "Reciba unha benvida a esta versión de proba de %1."

#: src/likeback.cpp:310
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, header text for released apps"
msgid "Welcome to %1."
msgstr "Benvido a %1."

#: src/likeback.cpp:317
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Welcome dialog text, explanation for both the like and dislike buttons"
msgid ""
"Each time you have a great or frustrating experience, please click on the "
"appropriate face below the window title bar, briefly describe what you like "
"or dislike and click on 'Send'."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que teña unha experiencia xenial ou frustrante, prema a cara "
"axeitada baixo a barra de título da xanela, describa brevemente o que lle "
"gusta ou desgusta e prema «Enviar»."

#: src/likeback.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, explanation for the like button alone"
msgid ""
"Each time you have a great experience, please click on the smiling face "
"below the window title-bar, briefly describe what you like and click on "
"'Send'."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que teña unha experiencia xenial, prema a cara co sorriso baixo a "
"barra de título da xanela, describa brevemente o que lle gusta e prema "
"«Enviar»."

#: src/likeback.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, explanation for the dislike button alone"
msgid ""
"Each time you have a frustrating experience, please click on the frowning "
"face below the window title-bar, briefly describe what you dislike and click "
"on 'Send'."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que teña unha experiencia frustrante, prema a cara anoxada baixo a "
"barra de título da xanela, describa brevemente o que lle desgusta e prema "
"«Enviar»."

#: src/likeback.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, explanation for the bug button"
msgid ""
"If you experience an improper behavior in the application, just click on the "
"broken-object icon in the top-right corner of the window, describe the "
"behavior and click on 'Send'."
msgstr ""
"Se experimenta un comportamento inesperado usando o aplicativo, prema a "
"icona de obxecto roto da esquina superior dereita da xanela, describa o "
"comportamento e prema «Enviar»."

#: src/likeback.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, usage example"
msgid "<b>I like</b> the new artwork. Very refreshing."
msgstr "<b>Gústame</b> o novo deseño. Moi innovador."

#: src/likeback.cpp:352
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, usage example"
msgid ""
"<b>I dislike</b> the welcome page of this assistant. Too time consuming."
msgstr ""
"<b>Desgústame</b> a páxina de benvida deste asistente. Fai perder demasiado "
"tempo."

#: src/likeback.cpp:359
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, usage example"
msgid ""
"<b>The application shows an improper behavior</b> when clicking the Add "
"button. Nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"<b>O aplicativo ten un comportamento inesperado</b> ao premer o botón "
"«Engadir». Non ocorre nada."

#: src/likeback.cpp:366
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, usage example"
msgid "<b>I desire a new feature</b> allowing me to send my work by email."
msgstr ""
"<b>Gustaríame unha nova funcionalidade</b> que me permita enviar o meu "
"traballo por correo electrónico."

#: src/likeback.cpp:378
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, us=the developers, it=the application"
msgid "To help us improve it, your comments are important."
msgstr "Os comentarios son importantes para axudarnos a mellorar."

#: src/likeback.cpp:381
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog text, header for the examples"
msgid "Example"
msgid_plural "Examples"
msgstr[0] "Exemplo"
msgstr[1] "Exemplos"

#: src/likeback.cpp:387
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Welcome dialog title"
msgid "Help Improve the Application"
msgstr "Axudar a mellorar o aplicativo"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Send a Comment to the Developers"
msgstr "Enviarlles un comentario aos desenvolvedores"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:135
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Feedback dialog text, message with one accepted language for the comments"
msgid ""
"Please, write it in <b>%1</b> (you may want to use an <a href=\"%2\">online "
"translation tool</a> for this).<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Escríbao en <b>%1</b> (pode valerse dun <a href=\"%2\">servizo de tradución "
"en internet</a>).<br/>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:140
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Feedback dialog text, message with list of accepted languages for the "
"comments"
msgid ""
"Please, write it in <b>%1 or %2</b> (you may want to use an <a href="
"\"%3\">online translation tool</a> for this).<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Escríbao en <b>%1 ou %2</b> (pode valerse dun <a href=\"%3\">servizo de "
"tradución en internet</a>).<br/>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Feedback dialog text, message to remind to balance the likes and dislikes"
msgid ""
"To make the comments you send more useful in improving this application, try "
"to send the same amount of positive and negative comments.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Para que os comentarios que envíe contribúan mellor á mellora do aplicativo, "
"intente enviar a mesma cantidade de comentarios positivos e negativos.<br/>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:158
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Feedback dialog text, text to disallow feature requests"
msgid ""
"Please, do not ask for new features: this kind of request will be ignored."
"<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Non pida novas funcionalidades; as peticións de novas funcionalidades "
"ignoraranse.<br/>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:163
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Feedback dialog text, %1=Application name,%2=message with list of accepted "
"languages for the comment,%3=optional text to remind to balance the likes "
"and dislikes,%4=optional text to disallow feature requests."
msgid ""
"<p>You can provide the developers a brief description of your opinions about "
"%1.<br/>%2 %3%4</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode fornecer aos desenvolvedores unha breve descrición das súas opinións "
"sobre %1.<br/>%2 %3%4</p>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The email address you have entered is not valid, and cannot be used: '%1'"
msgstr ""
"O enderezo de correo que inseriu non é correcto e non pode empregarse: «%1»"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:247
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Dialog box text"
msgid ""
"<p>Your comment has been sent successfully.</p><p>Thank you for your time.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>O seu comentario enviouse correctamente.</p><p>Grazas polo seu tempo.</p>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:249
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Dialog box title"
msgid "Comment Sent"
msgstr "Enviouse o comentario"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:260
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Dialog box text"
msgid ""
"<p>There has been an error while trying to send the comment.</p><p>Please, "
"try again later.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Produciuse un erro ao intentar enviar o comentario.</p><p>Inténteo de "
"novo máis tarde.</p>"

#: src/likebackdialog.cpp:262
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Dialog box title"
msgid "Comment Sending Error"
msgstr "Erro ao enviar o comentario"

